[113.424452, "o", "jq command used to generate the output.\r\n\r\n3. **`/app/jq_args.yaml`** — Contains the filter expression and an empty args list (no extra jq flags were needed).\r\n\r\n**Verification:**\r\n- The YAML-constructed command (`jq $(yq -r '.args[]' ...) \"$(yq -r '.filter' ...)\" /app/users.json`) produces byte-identical output.\r\n- All 346 user IDs match the active users from the input.\r\n- Users are correctly sorted alphabetically by username.\r\n- `primary_role` is `null` (JSON null) for the 50 users with empty roles arrays.\r\n\r\n[result] role=implementor model=qwen3.6-35b tools=20 surface=48cd0ade3676\r\n"]
